This license applies to the repository's aggregator skill, helper scripts,
validation harness, and documentation authored for this bundle. The corpus
entries summarize and point to third-party scientific papers; those original
papers, identifiers, figures, datasets, and claims remain under their own
respective copyrights and licenses. When reproducing or citing scientific
claims, cite the original papers named in the per-entry metadata.
